mplete with validation - Update\nform and result templates for improved UX and Telegram instructions -\nStrengthen Pydantic validation for airport codes and dates - Update\nrequirements and .gitignore for new dependencies and cache - Minor fixes\nto database and models for Telegram support", "created_at": "2025-09-29T13:41:49Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "66aa13450e6faecdbef2a4a7fb23b80d5080ef0b", "message": "Refactor index view to use helper functions", "created_at": "2025-09-25T09:30:46Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4cf1378b028aa0bc1e4136757c8abebdcbf93466", "message": "Add error handling and improve DB feedback\n\nThe commit modifies the application to properly handle database\noperation failures and provide appropriate feedback to users. It changes\nthe return values of database functions to include success status and\nimproves error handling throughout the application flow.\n\nKey changes: - Make database operations return success status - Add\nerror handling for failed DB operations - Update template to show\nsimpler success message - Remove unused flight checking code", "created_at": "2025-09-08T19:54:00Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "98dd40e44506a4e26a8959007e7fc064e2876d73", "message": "In Progress: Implementing scheduled flight checking\n- Fix recursive call error: replace self-call with\n  get_preferences_for_flight()\n- Fix flight checking logic: pass target_departure date instead of\n  arrival_airport code to sprawdzanie_lotow()\n- Fix Flask context error: extend app_context() scope to include\n  render_template call\n- Fix template variable mismatch: update data structure to match email\n  template expectations (flight.* variables)", "created_at": "2025-08-28T21:20:26Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "801c002d4a46debd3215b1150b2038a63d509240", "message": "In Progress: Changing E-mail Notification functionality, Adding flight preferences pulling from db to automated flight checking", "created_at": "2025-08-27T21:16:47Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7ee9f0967a432b581ef919ead4044644bf110b03", "message": "Refactor datbase connection method and separated database related classes to corresponding files.", "created_at": "2025-08-26T21:05:33Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "88b6aef6c6f48ae6fce3a65b835d8136aaae80b5", "message": "Refactor flight search functionality and enhance database interactions\n\n- Introduced Pydantic models for flight search parameters and user preferences to enforce data validation and improve code readability.\n- Updated the `api_connector` method in `data_grabber.py` to accept a single `FlightSearchParams` object instead of multiple parameters.\n- Enhanced date validation logic to ensure return date is after departure date.\n- Modified database interaction methods in `database.py` to handle user and flight preferences more robustly, including updates and inserts.\n- Improved error handling for database operations and added comments for clarity.\n- Updated HTML form to use date inputs for better user experience and added notification preferences.\n- Removed unnecessary comments and TODOs, and added new ones where applicable for future improvements.", "created_at": "2025-08-25T20:19:50Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3a73ed9b96a159c6cd0f6a08adb6160071b50049", "message": "Created class responsible for database connection", "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:33:02Z", "repo": "flight-assistant", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sh